      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">امغدت</span></b>  <i>She</i> (a woman) <i>suckled</i> her child;
(S, L, K;) and a she camel, &amp;c., her young one.
(S, L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">امغد</span>, (inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِمْغَادٌ</span>, L,) <i>He</i> (a man,
S, L,) <i>drank much,</i> or <i>abundantly:</i> (S, L, K:)
or <i>he drank long.</i> (AHn, L.)

